```html
<ul>
    {% for post in posts %}
        <li><a href="/post/{{ post.slug }}">{{ post.title }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
```
This code assumes you have a `posts` variable defined in your template engine (e.g., Jinja2, Mustache, etc.). You'll need to populate this variable with your post data.

To create a link to each post, simply add the following code to your template:
